  "description": "Storage Rules Test API verdicts for corpus scenario \"resource-object-identity\" (STORAGE-RES-IDENTITY). The resource binding's object-identity/time fields — name (full object path), timeCreated, updated, bucket — driving an extension guard, a freshness window, an immutability check, and an absent-property negation that must not false-allow.",
